# Sandboxed E2E: downloaded Obsidian builds, the vault copy and run artifacts.
# Generated by obsidian_plugin_e2e.
.e2e-obsidian/
e2e/.wdio/
# The scaffold's own vault: keep the directories (the service fails in onPrepare
# when the vault path, or its `.obsidian`, does not exist) but not the vault's
# contents. A bare `e2e/vault/` would ignore the directory itself, so a fresh
# clone would fail the first run again. Note this file is appended once; a vault
# created later at another path needs the same treatment by hand.
e2e/vault/*
!e2e/vault/.obsidian/
e2e/vault/.obsidian/*
!e2e/vault/.obsidian/.gitkeep
